{"id":"n13991-1-5","stage":3,"title":"식품점 · 食品店","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n13991-1-5-1","ko":"요즘은 식품점에서 반찬도 팔아요.","zh":"现在食品店也卖配菜呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘은","audio":"/audio/e48ea92a2eef5b38ed37.mp3"}},{"text":"식품점에서","meaning":"食品店","explanation":"식품점：食品店；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"식품점","audio":"/audio/be3b582538903f9c50d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13991","senseId":"1","lemma":"식품점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식품점에서","audio":"/audio/8b69af483a46eec81da3.mp3"}},{"text":"반찬도","meaning":"菜，菜肴","explanation":"반찬：菜，菜肴；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"반찬","audio":"/audio/dae8746e5842e5da92d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57641","senseId":"1","lemma":"반찬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반찬도","audio":"/audio/325e849c73f1272661a0.mp3"}},{"text":"팔아요.","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔아요","audio":"/audio/cb2e6af79b73ef47d50e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"be3b582538903f9c","term":"식품점","zh":"食品店","audio":"/audio/be3b582538903f9c50d9.mp3","entryId":"13991","definition":"销售各种食品的商店。","pronunciation":["식품점"]},{"id":"dae8746e5842e5da","term":"반찬","zh":"菜，菜肴","audio":"/audio/dae8746e5842e5da92d0.mp3","entryId":"57641","definition":"用餐时配着米饭一起吃的食物。","pronunciation":["반찬"]},{"i